WEBVTT

00:00:00.880 --> 00:00:01.940
A Climax Song?

00:00:01.940 --> 00:00:03.400
No!

00:00:05.750 --> 00:00:06.570
Kirika-chan!

00:00:07.020 --> 00:00:09.600
You tried to stop it with your 
Climax Song? That's crazy...

00:00:09.600 --> 00:00:13.910
<i>Kiri-chan! Can you hear me, Kiri-chan?!</i>

00:00:09.840 --> 00:00:12.340
Bring her in immediately!

00:00:12.340 --> 00:00:13.910
Get a medical team out there!

00:00:14.290 --> 00:00:18.160
If you seek to monopolize
 the power of the gods,

00:00:18.160 --> 00:00:21.630
then you are the ruler 
that stands in my way.

00:00:21.940 --> 00:00:24.700
You're quite stubborn.

00:00:25.330 --> 00:00:28.220
Perhaps that's why I find you so annoying.

00:00:28.510 --> 00:00:32.610
But the power of the gods
 will soon be complete.

00:00:32.610 --> 00:00:36.940
And then, you won't be 
able to stop me at all.

00:00:38.200 --> 00:00:41.350
You and I are enemies,

00:00:41.350 --> 00:00:44.110
each holding our own justice and 
unable to understand each other.

00:00:44.110 --> 00:00:49.060
But now we're looking the same 
direction, at the same opponent.

00:00:49.060 --> 00:00:51.940
The enemy is powerful. Overwhelming.

00:00:51.940 --> 00:00:54.960
So what will you do, Hibiki Tachibana?

00:00:55.540 --> 00:00:59.490
There's only one thing to say
 when you're fighting back.

00:01:00.170 --> 00:01:01.690
"Even if that's true!"

00:02:44.220 --> 00:02:48.730
<b>Episode 11
Ultimate Apotheosis</b>

00:02:55.240 --> 00:02:57.650
The medical team has rescued Kirika-chan!

00:02:58.150 --> 00:02:59.530
Good...

00:03:01.720 --> 00:03:03.640
Have the civilians been evacuated?

00:03:03.640 --> 00:03:06.080
They will be soon! I'm getting
 them out as fast as possible!

00:03:07.220 --> 00:03:11.320
So that thing has the power of a god?

00:03:11.620 --> 00:03:13.010
Is there no time?

00:03:13.010 --> 00:03:15.230
I know! The god-killer!

00:03:15.230 --> 00:03:17.840
We had a plan!

00:03:18.350 --> 00:03:21.100
Ogawa's got intelligence on it.

00:03:21.600 --> 00:03:24.800
But we have no new info...

00:03:30.110 --> 00:03:34.260
The power of the gods should 
be used for humanity's future!

00:03:34.260 --> 00:03:37.150
One person should not monopolize it.

00:03:37.510 --> 00:03:40.100
Humanity's future?

00:03:40.540 --> 00:03:42.030
Absurd.

00:03:50.730 --> 00:03:52.320
Why did you protect me?

00:03:52.320 --> 00:03:55.720
My friend said I was being selfish.

00:03:56.070 --> 00:03:57.300
Selfish?

00:03:57.740 --> 00:04:00.780
Don't try to team up just 
because you're weak!

00:04:12.920 --> 00:04:17.540
When someone else's power 
was about to crush me...

00:04:19.630 --> 00:04:22.280
If someone who had fought back against 
control was there to save me,

00:04:22.660 --> 00:04:25.060
things may have turned out differently.

00:04:25.330 --> 00:04:32.030
When I realized that, I decided 
I wanted to talk to you, not fight you,

00:04:32.030 --> 00:04:34.070
and my body moved on its own!

00:04:38.260 --> 00:04:40.020
Hibiki Tachibana...

00:04:41.140 --> 00:04:43.540
Your target is Tiki.

00:04:43.970 --> 00:04:47.960
The doll that is about to attain
 the power of the gods...

00:04:48.490 --> 00:04:52.560
Tiki... Tiki... Tiki... Antiki... tira...

00:04:52.560 --> 00:04:56.640
If its vessel is destroyed, the power
of the gods will be incomplete.

00:04:57.820 --> 00:05:00.170
Fighting together doesn't make us friends.

00:05:00.700 --> 00:05:02.390
It's me being selfish.

00:05:04.520 --> 00:05:07.390
If you're being selfish, 
I guess I don't have a choice!

00:05:09.420 --> 00:05:13.400
Lend me your power, to help someone else!

00:05:16.550 --> 00:05:21.830
<i>Hit 'em head on, right in 
the middle, never giving up!</i>

00:05:21.220 --> 00:05:26.200
So, you mistakenly believe that 
you two can do something together?

00:05:21.830 --> 00:05:27.160
<i>Give it everything you have 
and go beyond your limits!</i>

00:05:27.160 --> 00:05:33.590
<i>Each of us holds a different justice but</i>

00:05:33.590 --> 00:05:34.790
<i>For now we're brave!</i>

00:05:34.790 --> 00:05:36.800
<i>It's time for us to come together!</i>

00:05:36.800 --> 00:05:42.140
<i>We struggled against the 
agony of being controlled</i>

00:05:42.140 --> 00:05:47.310
<i>It felt like we could 
share what's in our hearts</i>

00:05:47.310 --> 00:05:53.020
<i>A hammer containing our 
ultimate (ultimate) feelings</i>

00:05:49.860 --> 00:05:54.370
She's fighting alongside the person 
she was just dueling?

00:05:53.020 --> 00:05:57.890
<i>Let's unleash it together</i>

00:05:54.370 --> 00:05:56.080
What kind of fighting style is that?

00:05:56.080 --> 00:06:00.990
You of all people know it's 
more effective than its looks.

00:05:57.890 --> 00:06:00.960
<i>I trust! Blooming Courage</i>

00:06:00.960 --> 00:06:03.720
<i>Not just clenching tight</i>

00:06:02.250 --> 00:06:04.100
But...

00:06:03.720 --> 00:06:08.480
<i>I want to open my hand and connect</i>

00:06:04.100 --> 00:06:06.100
That's not an easy foe to defeat.

00:06:07.850 --> 00:06:09.210
Yeah.

00:06:08.480 --> 00:06:11.240
<i>I believe! Blooming Courage</i>

00:06:09.610 --> 00:06:12.380
Their situation grows worse by the moment.

00:06:11.240 --> 00:06:14.120
<i>Even if we believe in different things</i>

00:06:14.120 --> 00:06:18.810
<i>Now for someone's sake</i>

00:06:18.810 --> 00:06:23.240
<i>Scream "Even if that's true!"</i>

00:06:22.360 --> 00:06:24.570
I won't let you!

00:06:26.250 --> 00:06:30.690
I'm the only one who gets 
to touch her all over!

00:06:31.020 --> 00:06:33.450
Merorin zukkyun!

00:06:39.660 --> 00:06:41.050
At this rate...

00:06:42.540 --> 00:06:48.630
But, Director, what happened
 to your Golden Transmutation?

00:06:50.530 --> 00:06:54.010
You don't need to hold back on us.

00:06:54.010 --> 00:06:57.130
So why aren't you using its insane power?

00:06:59.040 --> 00:07:04.770
The energy discharge from the heavenly 
ley lines wasn't part of your original plan.

00:07:05.030 --> 00:07:07.300
Opening the gate has exhausted you

00:07:07.300 --> 00:07:10.780
and you lack the power to 
do a Golden Transmutation.

00:07:11.380 --> 00:07:12.640
You heard that, right?

00:07:12.640 --> 00:07:13.320
Yes!

00:07:13.660 --> 00:07:17.290
<i>I trust! Blooming Courage</i>

00:07:17.290 --> 00:07:20.280
<i>Not just clenching tight</i>

00:07:17.410 --> 00:07:20.290
People won't like you if you're too smart.

00:07:20.280 --> 00:07:25.090
<i>I want to open my hand and connect</i>

00:07:25.090 --> 00:07:27.750
<i>I believe! Blooming Courage</i>

00:07:27.750 --> 00:07:30.590
<i>Even if we believe in different things</i>

00:07:30.590 --> 00:07:35.900
<i>Now, to the heaven in front of you</i>

00:07:35.900 --> 00:07:38.100
<i>Scream "Even if that's true!"</i>

00:07:38.340 --> 00:07:40.700
Divine punishment!

00:07:44.000 --> 00:07:45.920
Now, Hibiki Tachibana!!

00:07:45.920 --> 00:07:48.350
Before Tiki attains the power of the gods!

00:08:02.810 --> 00:08:06.900
The director of the Illuminati, 
the master of all alchemists...

00:08:06.900 --> 00:08:08.000
Was...

00:08:08.420 --> 00:08:09.500
A doll?

00:08:10.640 --> 00:08:12.410
A doll, you say?

00:08:15.220 --> 00:08:17.390
A doll, you say?!

00:08:17.750 --> 00:08:24.320
I'll make you pay for making Adam feel pain!

00:08:26.820 --> 00:08:27.770
What?

00:08:30.500 --> 00:08:33.440
The light... is being born!

00:08:35.400 --> 00:08:37.650
What's going on there?

00:08:38.180 --> 00:08:39.530
Monitors are back online!

00:08:39.900 --> 00:08:41.440
Putting onscreen.

00:08:46.780 --> 00:08:49.220
What...?

00:09:06.400 --> 00:09:08.750
The divine power has manifested.

00:09:08.750 --> 00:09:13.410
I was planning on taking it and 
leaving, at least for today.

00:09:14.080 --> 00:09:20.860
I'm sorry. They were being 
mean to you, and I...

00:09:20.860 --> 00:09:23.900
Well, you can't change it now.

00:09:24.340 --> 00:09:26.330
But since we're here...

00:09:29.800 --> 00:09:34.610
Let's show them the complete
 power of the gods.

00:09:34.610 --> 00:09:37.240
The terror of a divine weapon!

00:10:13.690 --> 00:10:16.010
All that power...

00:10:16.010 --> 00:10:18.470
Can a Symphogear take it?

00:10:18.840 --> 00:10:20.670
Inhuman...

00:10:20.670 --> 00:10:25.440
That's what you kept calling me, right?

00:10:27.580 --> 00:10:31.340
That's right. I am inhuman.

00:10:32.320 --> 00:10:34.730
I was never human to begin with.

00:10:35.010 --> 00:10:37.080
Adam Weishaupt.

00:10:37.080 --> 00:10:38.690
What are you?

00:10:41.960 --> 00:10:46.160
I was created as their representative.

00:10:46.160 --> 00:10:47.740
"Their"?

00:10:47.740 --> 00:10:51.750
But I was abandoned while 
I was still a prototype,

00:10:51.750 --> 00:10:55.630
under the completely unreasonable
 rationale that I was too perfect!

00:10:57.810 --> 00:10:59.170
Impossible...

00:10:59.650 --> 00:11:02.040
The perfect cannot be inferior 
to the imperfect...

00:11:04.040 --> 00:11:06.640
And I'm going to fix it...

00:11:07.160 --> 00:11:10.850
by ruling over perfect and imperfect!

00:11:15.770 --> 00:11:16.590
What?

00:11:16.590 --> 00:11:19.060
I can't let her fire off 
another one of those!

00:11:26.820 --> 00:11:27.790
Tiki?

00:11:47.970 --> 00:11:53.310
Cagliostro and Prelati died 
for a power like this?

00:11:59.320 --> 00:12:02.060
Footage from nearby security 
cameras has been lost.

00:12:34.690 --> 00:12:36.950
Incoming message from the Sielje Region.

00:12:37.340 --> 00:12:44.560
The directed energy storm struck a 
US military satellite and annihilated it.

00:12:44.560 --> 00:12:46.910
What about Hibiki and Saint Germain?

00:12:46.910 --> 00:12:49.380
The cameras in the area are still down.

00:12:49.380 --> 00:12:51.410
I'm getting footage from a nearby area...

00:12:51.410 --> 00:12:51.920
Commander!

00:12:52.420 --> 00:12:54.860
We're receiving inquiries 
from all the ministries!

00:12:54.860 --> 00:12:57.660
They can wait! Forget—

00:12:57.660 --> 00:12:58.850
<i>What's going on?</i>

00:13:00.880 --> 00:13:03.130
<i>I said, what is going on?</i>

00:13:04.030 --> 00:13:05.740
We're trying to find out now—

00:13:05.740 --> 00:13:07.590
<i>Fool.</i>

00:13:07.590 --> 00:13:11.610
<i>The world's governments have 
already found out about this.</i>

00:13:11.610 --> 00:13:14.950
<i>Which means their next move is obvious.</i>

00:13:14.950 --> 00:13:18.360
<i>They'll talk of a joint 
offensive and peacekeeping,</i>

00:13:18.360 --> 00:13:22.720
<i>and wave the flag of the United Nations 
while bringing their militaries here.</i>

00:13:22.720 --> 00:13:24.160
<i>How do you not understand?</i>

00:13:24.430 --> 00:13:27.430
<i>But there are still options!</i>

00:13:27.430 --> 00:13:29.220
<i>That's our job―</i>

00:13:29.160 --> 00:13:31.240
<b>Transmission Ended</b>

00:13:31.590 --> 00:13:38.910
Only I, a true protector, 
can defend this nation.

00:13:39.720 --> 00:13:41.550
Was that...

00:13:41.550 --> 00:13:45.490
The Kazanari family will get 
involved in this battle.

00:13:47.060 --> 00:13:48.250
Monitor coming online!

00:13:49.420 --> 00:13:50.210
Hibiki-san!

00:13:50.210 --> 00:13:51.760
That dummy!

00:13:51.760 --> 00:13:53.420
She's in love with the ground!

00:13:53.760 --> 00:13:58.390
A-Adam... I did m-my best...

00:13:58.390 --> 00:14:01.400
P-Praise me.

00:14:01.750 --> 00:14:04.880
You're a good girl, Tiki.

00:14:04.880 --> 00:14:07.740
Then why won't you hug me?

00:14:07.740 --> 00:14:11.870
If you don't hug me, 
I won't know you love me.

00:14:11.870 --> 00:14:15.030
I'd love to.

00:14:15.480 --> 00:14:20.670
But I can't. You're too big for my arms.

00:14:20.670 --> 00:14:25.800
Meanie! But I love that about you, too...

00:14:30.820 --> 00:14:32.780
With my full-power bullets...

00:14:38.170 --> 00:14:39.860
Even still...

00:14:40.140 --> 00:14:42.980
It's just like the Youaltepuztli...

00:14:43.300 --> 00:14:45.480
It makes it so the damage never happened!

00:14:52.760 --> 00:14:56.040
Overwhelming power and absolute defense...

00:14:56.300 --> 00:15:00.010
Yeah. Even if the recoil 
corruption is removed,

00:15:00.010 --> 00:15:01.950
how do we fight back?

00:15:02.840 --> 00:15:05.200
Humanity is incomplete.

00:15:05.200 --> 00:15:10.180
It must be ruled, controlled, 
and turned into the perfect army

00:15:10.180 --> 00:15:12.890
by me, the man who surpasses humanity.

00:15:13.520 --> 00:15:15.860
You're insane, doll.

00:15:15.860 --> 00:15:19.260
You're a failure as an alchemist.

00:15:19.260 --> 00:15:23.550
Accept control, if you 
truly seek perfection!

00:15:23.550 --> 00:15:27.520
Everything about my desire for 
freedom from control was used,

00:15:27.520 --> 00:15:29.300
and disappeared into nothing.

00:15:29.650 --> 00:15:31.430
My ideals, my beliefs...

00:15:31.430 --> 00:15:34.530
All the lives I sacrificed...

00:15:36.450 --> 00:15:41.500
I don't even need to use the
 divine weapon to end this.

00:15:41.500 --> 00:15:45.900
I'll finish you myself,
 once and for all.

00:15:46.750 --> 00:15:49.480
Are we just waiting for 
the mandate of heaven?

00:15:50.930 --> 00:15:55.860
<i>"Don't give up." That's 
what she'd say, isn't it?</i>

00:15:55.860 --> 00:15:58.440
A message of unknown origin.

00:15:58.440 --> 00:16:01.040
It's encrypted and we can't 
identify the speaker.

00:16:01.040 --> 00:16:02.920
But this is...

00:16:03.740 --> 00:16:06.930
The decoded Valverde documents?

00:16:06.930 --> 00:16:09.560
<i>It's all the documents we have.</i>

00:16:09.560 --> 00:16:13.830
<i>The information on the god-killer 
contained in here will be the key.</i>

00:16:13.830 --> 00:16:16.860
The god-killer? Why...?

00:16:17.160 --> 00:16:20.960
<i>Intelligence was researching the god-killer</i>

00:16:20.960 --> 00:16:24.410
<i>when we made contact with them and 
succeeded in getting their help.</i>

00:16:24.770 --> 00:16:25.890
Is this...

00:16:25.890 --> 00:16:30.960
<i>The spear that was once used to ensure 
that the child of the gods was dead.</i>

00:16:31.450 --> 00:16:36.760
<i>This ancient spear held immense power,</i>

00:16:36.760 --> 00:16:42.200
<i>but the documents said it did not 
originally have the power to kill a god.</i>

00:16:42.200 --> 00:16:44.190
But how, then?

00:16:44.540 --> 00:16:51.060
<i>We believe that over 2,000 years of myths 
about the death of the god distorted the truth.</i>

00:16:51.380 --> 00:16:53.540
A philosophical weapon?

00:16:53.540 --> 00:16:57.030
The one that was at the center 
of the Alexandria incident?

00:16:57.030 --> 00:17:00.870
<i>This spear, which the Germans sought 
during the last great war is...</i>

00:17:01.990 --> 00:17:04.070
Gungnir?

00:17:04.670 --> 00:17:07.030
<i>That's right...</i>

00:17:07.420 --> 00:17:08.370
Tachibana.

00:17:08.720 --> 00:17:12.590
If there's still something I can do,

00:17:12.900 --> 00:17:16.800
and it needs my Gungnir...

00:17:16.800 --> 00:17:18.760
She realized?

00:17:19.110 --> 00:17:21.270
It just needs a little more effort...

00:17:21.620 --> 00:17:24.450
I can do that!

00:17:24.980 --> 00:17:25.880
Tiki!

00:17:30.880 --> 00:17:33.520
I'll stop you, god-killer!

00:17:36.440 --> 00:17:39.400
Now I understand.

00:17:39.650 --> 00:17:44.900
That seemingly random Golden Transmutation
 wasn't targeting the Symphogears.

00:17:45.580 --> 00:17:49.710
It was to keep them from finding out 
something you didn't want them to know.

00:17:50.070 --> 00:17:53.720
I told you... You're too smart!

00:18:07.020 --> 00:18:07.930
Impossible!

00:18:07.930 --> 00:18:11.930
Disappear! Die dreaming of your ideals!

00:18:12.300 --> 00:18:14.360
Go... Go...

00:18:14.360 --> 00:18:17.080
Go, Hibiki Tachibana!

00:18:19.000 --> 00:18:21.480
She's getting too cocky!

00:18:22.230 --> 00:18:25.630
I will go forward! Forward! Forward!

00:18:25.630 --> 00:18:28.950
If I stop here, I'll lose so 
much ground I'll never recover.

00:18:28.950 --> 00:18:31.930
I can't give up!

00:18:35.140 --> 00:18:37.750
Don't let her get close to you!

00:18:41.800 --> 00:18:45.360
Don't cause problems for Adam!

00:18:54.520 --> 00:18:56.390
The divine weapon can't recover!

00:18:56.640 --> 00:18:58.030
It's working...

00:18:58.030 --> 00:18:59.530
Is it really working?

00:18:59.530 --> 00:19:02.170
The god-killing philosophical weapon?

00:19:07.430 --> 00:19:08.280
Kiri-chan!

00:19:08.670 --> 00:19:16.170
<i>The last plane that took off from Valverde 
contained records from the last war.</i>

00:19:17.260 --> 00:19:21.290
That crazy risk we took wasn't for nothing!

00:19:21.670 --> 00:19:27.310
Tell me... Why are you giving us the 
secret information your country discovered?

00:19:27.780 --> 00:19:30.030
<i>They said they heard a song.</i>

00:19:30.510 --> 00:19:31.520
A song?

00:19:32.100 --> 00:19:34.470
My co-worker told me that.

00:19:39.200 --> 00:19:43.140
<i>In a burning sky, they heard a song, they said.</i>

00:19:43.140 --> 00:19:46.660
<i>So I, too, wanted to hear it!</i>

00:19:47.070 --> 00:19:49.070
It's over...

00:19:49.070 --> 00:19:51.180
Hibiki Tachibana!

00:19:56.800 --> 00:19:58.370
Stop, god-killer!

00:20:00.540 --> 00:20:03.550
These fists reach the eight extremes!

00:20:03.550 --> 00:20:06.640
They can open the strongest gates!

00:20:08.090 --> 00:20:10.050
Here's your hug, Tiki!

00:20:10.050 --> 00:20:14.020
Let go of the divine power 
and jump into my arms!

00:20:14.020 --> 00:20:16.980
I love you, Adam!

00:20:28.830 --> 00:20:30.670
At the most important moment,

00:20:30.950 --> 00:20:33.120
she always pulls through!

00:20:33.430 --> 00:20:35.760
I love you, Adam! I love you!

00:20:35.760 --> 00:20:39.040
So hold me! Don't let me go!

00:20:39.040 --> 00:20:40.890
I want my heart to skip a beat!

00:20:41.490 --> 00:20:43.110
Romance-addled little girl...

00:20:43.110 --> 00:20:45.490
You always annoy me so greatly.

00:20:45.490 --> 00:20:47.320
But you made it just in time.

00:20:48.660 --> 00:20:55.340
The doll to which the power of 
the gods is to be attached...

00:20:57.030 --> 00:20:58.410
Why?

00:20:58.810 --> 00:21:02.670
This is much more useful!

00:21:03.170 --> 00:21:05.720
I'll attach it to this arm!

00:21:06.200 --> 00:21:12.620
I'm no longer Adam Weishaupt. 
I shall become Adam Kadmon!

00:21:13.180 --> 00:21:15.720
The model for the new world!

00:21:17.060 --> 00:21:18.670
What's going on?

00:21:20.190 --> 00:21:22.630
What is this?

00:21:27.740 --> 00:21:28.980
What's going on?

00:21:37.890 --> 00:21:40.430
Hey, what are you doing?

00:21:47.310 --> 00:21:54.030
The power of the gods should only 
be able to dwell within a pure soul...

00:21:54.680 --> 00:21:58.990
It cannot dwell within the body of
 a human born with original sin...
